订购克雷格·托马斯的处女作小说《事情不是这样的》（That's Not How It Happened），各大书店均有销售，并可在 CraigThomasRider.com 阅读他已发表的其他文章。

00:56:08.190 --> 00:56:13.119
And you could subscribe to my own Dead Father's Society on Substack.
你还可以在Substack上订阅我自己的《已故父亲协会》（Dead Father's Society）。

00:56:13.119 --> 00:56:20.380
To learn about how you make a difference, this shows ongoing campaign to raise funds for congenital heart disease research.
想要了解如何为先天性心脏病研究筹集资金这一本节目的持续公益活动贡献力量，

00:56:20.380 --> 00:56:24.619
Check out the Make a Difference tab at the top of our website.
请查看我们网站顶部的“做出改变”标签页。

00:56:24.619 --> 00:56:29.179
People will, in fact, dance.
人们事实上会跳舞。

00:56:29.179 --> 00:56:33.199
Real question, it just hit me.
真心发问，我突然想到了一个问题。

00:56:33.199 --> 00:56:35.650
Am I in love with you?
我是不是爱上你了？

00:56:35.650 --> 00:56:38.210
We're just New York City.
我们只是纽约市。
